abstract: "DevRoadmaps is an open-source pedagogical software platform and progressive web application providing interactive computer science curricula, structured competency pathways across 20 technical domains, 870+ topic graphs, and offline-accessible educational resources aligned with UN SDG 4 (Quality Education)."
